    <comment>New package python-torchaudio for openSUSE:Factory from science:machinelearning (ComfyUI cone). pluskalm is the science:machinelearning package maintainer.

INTERDEPENDENT REQUESTS - please stage together with the ComfyUI cone (see comment on sr#1372800).

Fri Aug 21 08:56:25 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal &lt;mpluskal@suse.com&gt;

- Initial package of python-torchaudio 2.11.0:
  * Audio signal processing for PyTorch (CPU-only)
  * Upstream 2.11.0 is the latest release and is documented as
    compatible with later torch versions (Factory python-torch
    2.12.0); there is no 2.12.0 torchaudio tag
  * Builds the C++ extensions (lfilter, RNNT, forced_align,
    overdrive) with USE_CUDA=0; CUDA CTC decoder is not built
  * Set PYTHONPATH so PEP 517 can import tools/setup_helpers
</comment>
